<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="git-addon-git-menu-and-contextual-actions">
  <title>Git Menu and Contextual Actions</title>
  <shortdesc>The top-level <ph keyref="plugin-git-client"/> menu and the contextual Git actions in
    other views and editors.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git menu</indexterm></indexterm>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>contextual actions</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <refbody>
    <section id="section_git_menu">
      <title>Git Menu</title>
      <p>The <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-git"/> menu
        groups repository-level commands:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><b>Repository setup</b> —
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-clone"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-open"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-create-in-project"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-show-working-copy-in"/>.</li>
        <li><b>Synchronization</b> —
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-push"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-pull"/> (with
            merge, rebase, and other-branch options), and
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-fetch"/>.</li>
        <li><b>Views and information</b> —
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-show-staging"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-show-branches"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-show-tags"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-show-history"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-submodule"/>.</li>
        <li><b>Stash</b> —
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-stash-changes"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-list-stashes"/>.</li>
        <li><b>Remote and settings</b> —
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-manage-remotes"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-track-remote"/>,
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-edit-config"/>,
            and <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-settings"/>
            (Preferences and
            <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-reset-credentials"/>).</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section id="section_contextual">
      <title>Contextual Actions</title>
      <p>A contextual
        <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-git"/> submenu
        appears in the <uicontrol>Project</uicontrol> view, the <uicontrol>DITA Maps
          Manager</uicontrol>, and the editor, offering the Git actions that apply to the selected
        resource — such as staging, comparing, showing history, and showing blame. For a folder in
        the <uicontrol>Project</uicontrol> view that isn't yet a repository, the only action is
          <uicontrol conref="lib/git-menu-uicontrols.dita#git-menu-uicontrols/menu-create-here"/>.</p>
    </section>
  </refbody>
</reference>
